The repo's older BOSL2 pin lacks struct_set/struct_val. This is the existing
assets/openConnect/NOTICE render pin. No library source is committed here.

From the repository root, set OPENSCADPATH to the parent of that BOSL2 checkout:
openscad --export-format=binstl -o assets/openConnect-gridfinity-shelf/mesh/default.stl assets/openConnect-gridfinity-shelf/openconnect_gridfinity_shelf_online.scad
For magnets add: -D 'baseplate_style="Magnet - All"'
For wide add: -D gridfinity_width_grids=4
Mesh hashes are recorded in mesh/SHA256SUMS.
